# Add an API: append a block, no restart (hot-reload on mtime).
# kind: openai (default, covers Groq/Together/DeepSeek/xAI/Mistral/OpenRouter/...)
#       | ollama (no key needed) | anthropic | gemini | azure
# provider: optional group for the circuit breaker (defaults to name).
#           targets sharing a provider trip one shared breaker.

